    <bpmn:process id="W_W3785" name="W3785. Global Sourcing Strategy &amp; Import Category Sourcing Plan" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual merchandise/financial plan (links to VS-101); category strategy cycle
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise import sourcing (~40% of COGS)
Owner: Global Sourcing / VP Merchandising
Participants: Global Sourcing, Merchandising/Buyers (links to VS-01/VS-19), Supply Planning (links to VS-02), Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Quality (links to VS-31), Finance (links to VS-17.4/VS-106), Compliance (links to VS-87/VS-22), Strategy (links to VS-33)
Source: workflow W3785 — Global Sourcing Strategy &amp; Import Category Sourcing Plan</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3785_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3785_Lane1" name="Global Sourcing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3785_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3785_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3785_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3785_Lane2" name="VP Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3785_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3785_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3785_Start4" name="Annual merchandise/financial plan (links to VS-101); category strategy cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3785_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3785_Task5" name="Global Sourcing/Merchandising define the global sourcing strategy: which…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Global Sourcing/Merchandising define the global sourcing strategy: which categories/SKUs to import vs source locally (informed by landed cost, lead time, quality, IP, volume), the import category sourcing plan per category (steel/cement/lumber, tiles, electrical, paint/coatings, power tools, appliances, hardware), target source countries, and the make/buy/consolidation approach, aligned to the merchandise financial plan (links to VS-101) and assortment (links to VS-01.1)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Merchandising
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3785_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3785_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3785_Task6" name="Global Sourcing/Finance model the import business case per category: FOB cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Global Sourcing/Finance model the import business case per category: FOB cost, freight, duty, brokerage, inland, financing (LC cost), shrink/damage, and overhead against local-source alternatives; confirm the import landed-cost advantage and margin contribution (links to VS-106 commodity, VS-110 freight)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3785_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3785_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3785_Task7" name="VP Merchandising/Executive ratify the global sourcing strategy, approve the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Merchandising/Executive ratify the global sourcing strategy, approve the sourcing-model and source-market decisions (links to W3786/W3787), and cascade import sourcing targets to buyers/category managers
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising / Global Sourcing
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3785_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3785_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3785_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3785_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-595 (ensure controlled execution — Global Sourcing Strategy, Source-Market &amp; Sourcing-Model Design (PA-122.1).) | - operational: consolidated category sourcing plan; operational: total-landed-cost framework (links to W3788)
Owner: Global Sourcing / VP Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3785_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3785_Annotation9" targetRef="W3785_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3785_Flow11" sourceRef="W3785_Start4" targetRef="W3785_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3785_Flow12" sourceRef="W3785_Task5" targetRef="W3785_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3785_Flow13" sourceRef="W3785_Task6" targetRef="W3785_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3785_Flow14" sourceRef="W3785_Task7" targetRef="W3785_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3785_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3785_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3785">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3785_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3785_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
