    <bpmn:process id="W_W3786" name="W3786. Source-Market &amp; Country Strategy, Geographic Risk Diversification" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W3785); geopolitical event; tariff change
Frequency: Annual + on event
Volume: Source-market portfolio (China/Taiwan/Indonesia/Malaysia/Japan/Europe + alternates)
Owner: Global Sourcing
Participants: Global Sourcing, Merchandising (links to VS-01), Supply Planning (links to VS-02), Compliance (links to VS-87/VS-86), Quality (links to VS-31), Risk (links to VS-21.2), Finance (links to VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W3786 — Source-Market &amp; Country Strategy, Geographic Risk Diversification</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3786_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3786_Lane1" name="Global Sourcing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3786_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3786_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3786_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3786_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3786_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3786_Start3" name="Strategy (W3785); geopolitical event; tariff change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3786_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3786_Task4" name="Global Sourcing define the source-market and country strategy per category…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Global Sourcing define the source-market and country strategy per category: country capability/cost/quality/lead-time assessment, concentration limits (avoid over-reliance on a single country/vendor), and alternate-source qualification (e.g., Vietnam/India alternates to China for tools/hardware) — informed by trade-compliance and sanctions screening (links to W3792/VS-86)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Compliance / Quality
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Annual + on event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3786_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3786_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3786_Task5" name="Global Sourcing/Risk assess and manage geographic/country risk…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Global Sourcing/Risk assess and manage geographic/country risk: tariff/trade-policy exposure (links to VS-87), geopolitical and shipping-lane risk (links to VS-02.3/VS-69), currency exposure (links to VS-18), and concentration risk; define diversification thresholds and a fallback sourcing map
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Risk / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Annual + on event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3786_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3786_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3786_Task6" name="Global Sourcing/Compliance screen all current and prospective source…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Global Sourcing/Compliance screen all current and prospective source countries/vendors for sanctions, restricted-party, and trade-policy exposure (links to VS-86/VS-87), and maintain the approved-country/vendor-source list
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3786_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3786_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3786_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3786_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-71 (ensure import sourcing &amp; social-compliance verification.) | - operational: concentration limits and alternate sources; operational: screening (links to VS-86)
Owner: Global Sourcing</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3786_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3786_Annotation8" targetRef="W3786_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3786_Flow10" sourceRef="W3786_Start3" targetRef="W3786_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3786_Flow11" sourceRef="W3786_Task4" targetRef="W3786_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3786_Flow12" sourceRef="W3786_Task5" targetRef="W3786_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3786_Flow13" sourceRef="W3786_Task6" targetRef="W3786_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
