    <bpmn:process id="W_W3788" name="W3788. Total-Landed-Cost Sourcing Framework, Incoterms &amp; Payment-Terms Strategy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sourcing decision (W3785/W3787); cost review
Frequency: Per sourcing decision + quarterly
Volume: Enterprise landed-cost framework
Owner: Global Sourcing / Logistics Finance
Participants: Global Sourcing, Logistics Finance (links to VS-17.4), Freight (links to VS-110), Customs (links to VS-87), Treasury (links to VS-18), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Commodity (links to VS-106)
Source: workflow W3788 — Total-Landed-Cost Sourcing Framework, Incoterms &amp; Payment-Terms Strategy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3788_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3788_Lane1" name="Global Sourcing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3788_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3788_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3788_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3788_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3788_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3788_Start3" name="Sourcing decision (W3785/W3787); cost review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3788_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3788_Task4" name="Global Sourcing/Logistics-Finance maintain the total-landed-cost (TLC)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Global Sourcing/Logistics-Finance maintain the total-landed-cost (TLC) framework and calculator: FOB/ex-works unit cost, ocean freight &amp; surcharges (BAF/CAF), duty/tariff (links to VS-87), brokerage, insurance, inland, port/handling, LC/financing cost (links to VS-18), shrink/damage allowance, and overhead → landed cost per unit and per SKU, by source/vendor/route
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Logistics Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising / Finance
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3788_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3788_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3788_Task5" name="Global Sourcing/Legal define the Incoterms strategy (FOB, EXW, CIF, DDP) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Global Sourcing/Legal define the Incoterms strategy (FOB, EXW, CIF, DDP) and payment-terms strategy (LC at sight, usance LC, TT, open account, CAD) per source/vendor/category, balancing cost, control, risk, and cash flow (links to VS-18/VS-105); negotiate into contracts
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Legal / Treasury
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3788_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3788_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3788_Task6" name="Global Sourcing/Finance compare landed cost across sources/vendors/routes and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Global Sourcing/Finance compare landed cost across sources/vendors/routes and recommend the lowest-TLC sourcing that meets quality/lead-time/risk constraints (links to W3807), tracking actual vs planned landed cost
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3788_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3788_End7" name="Complete">
